<p>
	The Microsoft 365 integration for UCS allows to easily provision Azure Active Directory accounts with single sign-on for users.
</p>
<ul>
	<li>
		To use this app, an Azure AD administrator account is required. In addition, Microsoft 365 licenses are required for the account
	</li>
	<li>
		To test Microsoft 365 free of charge, a test account can be created at <a href="https://products.office.com/business/">products.office.com</a>.
	</li>
	<li>
		To create, modify and delete accounts, this app needs administrative access to the Azure Active Directory account. A <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="require('umc/app').openModule('office365')">setup wizard</a> will guide you through the configuration process.
	</li>
	<li>
		Education Class support: Groups of type "Education Class" can be provisioned via the Microsoft Graph Education Roster API, with attributes for class code, grade, and academic term. Requires an Azure Education License and School Data Sync. Enable via the app setting office365/education/enabled.
	</li>
</ul>
